'''Tythoni Square'''<ref name="R1 UVG" /> was a municipal area in the [[Holy Quarter]] of [[Jedha]]'s [[Jedha City|Holy City]]<ref name="Rogue One novel" /> that shared its name with the [[Deep Core]] [[planet]] [[Tython]].<ref name="DA 40">[[Doctor Aphra (2016) 40|''Doctor Aphra'' (2016) 40]]</ref> In [[1 BBY]],<ref name="Date Note" /> the square was the site of an [[Jedha insurgency|ambush]] on an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[kyber crystal]] [[TX-225 GAVw "Occupier" combat assault tank|transport]] by [[Saw Gerrera]]'s [[Partisans]] shortly before the [[city]]'s [[Destruction of Jedha City|destruction]] by the [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star]].<ref name="R1" />

